%N A398870 a(n) is the number of tilings of a 6 X 5n rectangle into I-pentominoes (no reflections, only rotations).
%H A398870 Nicolas Bělohoubek, Karol Gryszka and Antonín Slavík, <a href="https://www.karlin.mff.cuni.cz/~slavik/papers/pentominoes.pdf">A Guided Tour to Pentomino Tilings</a>
%H A398870 <a href="/index/Rec#order_5">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (5,-10,10,-7,1).
%F A398870 a(n) = 5*a(n-1) - 10*a(n-2) + 10*a(n-3) - 7*a(n-4) + a(n-5), n > 4.
%F A398870 G.f.: (1-x)^4/((1-x)^5-2*x).
